    "title": "How Malachi Barton Handles His Personal Life in the Public Eye",
    "text": "Malachi Barton is keeping it real when it comes to handling internet rumors and life in the public eye.\nThe ‘Camp Rock 3′ star tells ET at Variety’s Power of Young Hollywood event: “I would be lying if I said it was easy. There’s this crazy pressure that is put on a person when their life is on screen.”\nMore from Entertainment Tonight: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdtXPiqI2cLorKaPrfpKc4g?sub_confirmation=1\nExclusives from #EntertainmentTonight :\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLQwITQ__CeH2Y_7g2xeiNDa0vQsROQQgv",
